bootstrapped.body:
The server operator added a new owner to the admin panel: {name} ({email}).

When: {time}

The new owner will receive an invitation and sign in after setting up a second factor. If you did not expect this, check the activity log in the admin panel: {origin}

locked.body:
The staff account of {name} ({email}) is locked for an hour after five wrong second-factor codes in a row.

When: {time}
Network: {ip}

If this was not the staff member, contact them and reset their access in the admin panel if needed: {origin}
